      },
      "message": "test(ui): run the diag event-level test in a binary of its own\n\ndiag_lines_are_tracing_events_at_their_level lost its INFO line in some\nparallel lib runs. tracing caches the interest of each callsite for the\nwhole process, and other lib tests hit the same diag::info callsite on\nother threads while the test installs its thread-local subscriber. A\nregistration on another thread could cache the INFO callsite as never.\n\nThe test moves to crates/ui/tests/diag_events.rs, which holds this one\ntest only, so no other thread uses the callsites. The lib keeps the\nmacro test.\n\nFixes #2595\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
